;font-weight:700\">Evite</p><div class=\"tw\"><table><thead><tr><th>Hunt</th><th class=\"r\">Nv</th><th>Tipos</th><th class=\"r\">Bate</th><th class=\"r\">Apanha</th><th class=\"r\">Abates/h</th><th>Pior 5 s</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"clk\" data-w=\"Abra\" data-l=\"10\"><td>Abra</td><td class=\"r\">10</td><td><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#d06688\"><i></i>Psíquico</span></td><td class=\"r\">×1</td><td class=\"r\">×1</td><td class=\"r\">60</td><td><span class=\"mini\"><span style=\"width:100%;background:var(--bad)\"></span><i></i></span> 515%</td><td><span class=\"pill bad\">Morre</span></td></tr><tr class=\"clk\" data-w=\"Metapod\" data-l=\"10\"><td>Metapod</td><td class=\"r\">10</td><td><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#98a83a\"><i></i>Inseto</span></td><td class=\"r\">×1</td><td class=\"r\">×1</td><td class=\"r\">20</td><td><span class=\"mini\"><span style=\"width:100%;background:var(--bad)\"></span><i></i></span> 453%</td><td><span class=\"pill bad\">Morre</span></td></tr><tr class=\"clk\" data-w=\"Kakuna\" data-l=\"10\"><td>Kakuna</td><td class=\"r\">10</td><td><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#98a83a\"><i></i>Inseto</span> <span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#9a5c9a\"><i></i>Veneno</span></td><td class=\"r\">×1</td><td class=\"r\">×1</td><td class=\"r\">20</td><td><span class=\"mini\"><span style=\"width:100%;background:var(--bad)\"></span><i></i></span> 451%</td><td><span class=\"pill bad\">Morre</span></td></tr><tr class=\"clk\" data-w=\"Mankey\" data-l=\"10\"><td>Mankey</td><td class=\"r\">10</td><td><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#b0483f\"><i></i>Lutador</span></td><td class=\"r\">×1</td><td class=\"r\">×1</td><td class=\"r\">40</td><td><span class=\"mini\"><span style=\"width:100%;background:var(--bad)\"></span><i></i></span> 370%</td><td><span class=\"pill bad\">Morre</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
    },
    "bosses": {
      "html": "<div class=\"tw\"><table><thead><tr><th>Boss</th><th>Nv</th><th>Bate</th><th>Apanha</th><th>Dano / HP do boss</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Raikou</td><td>650</td><td>×1</td><td>×0.333</td><td>165,8%</td></tr><tr><td>Entei</td><td>650</td><td>×1</td><td>×0.333</td><td>154,2%</td></tr><tr><td>Suicune</td><td>650</td><td>×1</td><td>×0.333</td><td>139%</td></tr><tr><td>Kyogre</td><td>3100</td><td>×1</td><td>×0.333</td><td>118,4%</td></tr><tr><td>Zapdos</td><td>300</td><td>×1</td><td>×1</td><td>86,4%</td></tr><tr><td>Palkia</td><td>9750</td><td>×2.5</td><td>×2.5</td><td>83,9%</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"note\">Os 6 bosses em que este exemplar entrega mais dano proporcional ao HP estimado, no nível exigido pelo boss. Considera equipe de 5 nesse nível. HP e golpes do boss são estimados pela espécie; confira a equipe completa na aba Equipes.</p>"
    },
    "build": {
      "html": "<div class=\"partner\"><b>Furious Scizor</b><span>Hunt Nv 150 na Outland</span>\n     <div class=\"why\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#98a83a\"><i></i>Inseto</span> <span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#9ea3b3\"><i></i>Metálico</span> &nbsp;Aguenta Gelo, Dragão, Fada. </div></div><div class=\"partner\"><b>Blastoise</b><span>Hunt Nv 80</span>\n     <div class=\"why\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#5d84cf\"><i></i>Água</span> &nbsp;Reforço de stats (BST 530).</div></div><div class=\"partner\"><b>Roll Donphan</b><span>Hunt Nv 150 na Outland</span>\n     <div class=\"why\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#c4a663\"><i></i>Terra</span> &nbsp;Reforço de stats (BST 500).</div></div><div class=\"partner\"><b>Dark Crobat</b><span>Hunt Nv 150 na Outland</span>\n     <div class=\"why\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#9a5c9a\"><i></i>Veneno</span> <span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#9a8fd6\"><i></i>Voador</span> &nbsp;Reforço de stats (BST 535).</div></div><p class=\"note\">Ele sofre de Gelo, Dragão, Fada; 3 desses tipos ficam cobertos. A escolha é por tipo e BST. Simule cada parceiro selecionando ele na busca.</p>"
